WEBVTT

02:01.400 --> 02:02.520
Hang in there.

02:03.720 --> 02:05.840
I know it hurts. Hang in there.

02:10.000 --> 02:12.560
Come on. I'll untie you.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.040
Does it hurt?

02:20.960 --> 02:22.320
Those traffickers should rot in hell!

02:22.400 --> 02:23.240
They should rot!

02:23.320 --> 02:24.960
They all deserve it! They all do!

02:26.600 --> 02:27.440
That kid.

02:27.520 --> 02:29.000
Why did he go to your place after?

02:31.320 --> 02:33.360
Pony, he told me

02:33.440 --> 02:35.400
his parents always fought.

02:36.120 --> 02:38.440
He didn't want to go home.

02:39.560 --> 02:43.040
He asked me if I could take him in.

03:04.040 --> 03:06.840
Come on. Have a bit more.

03:09.440 --> 03:10.520
Thanks, Daddy Peng.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.000
Pony.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.520
Eat up. Here.

03:40.520 --> 03:43.440
-Thanks, Daddy Peng.
-You're welcome.

03:52.440 --> 03:55.120
CHINESE HISTORY, GRADE 8 VOL.2

04:11.880 --> 04:12.920
Daddy Peng.

04:13.640 --> 04:15.120
I'm going back to school today.

04:15.200 --> 04:18.120
Okay. Then after school, I'll pick you up.

04:18.200 --> 04:19.000
No need.

04:19.079 --> 04:20.720
I haven't been home for days.

04:20.800 --> 04:22.160
My parents must be worried.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.760
I won't come here anymore.

04:27.840 --> 04:30.560
Daddy Peng, thanks for taking care of me.

04:47.320 --> 04:48.440
Dad's here.

04:49.440 --> 04:50.560
This is your home.

04:50.640 --> 04:51.680
From now on,

04:51.760 --> 04:54.160
focus on your studies
and keep up with your homework.

04:56.080 --> 04:58.840
As for school,
you don't need to go anymore.

05:00.080 --> 05:01.680
This is your home.

05:02.440 --> 05:03.840
I'll teach you at home.

05:05.680 --> 05:07.840
Pony is too young. He doesn't understand.

05:08.360 --> 05:11.040
He has no idea how I feel as his dad.

05:11.120 --> 05:14.720
What I fear most is that
he'll run away again someday.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.600
Then what am I supposed to do?

05:16.680 --> 05:18.280
What am I supposed to do?

05:19.240 --> 05:21.480
That's why I need to keep more ponies.

05:21.560 --> 05:23.160
So I can feel at ease.

05:42.080 --> 05:42.920
Going to an internet cafe?

05:43.840 --> 05:44.880
I'll give you a ride.

05:48.840 --> 05:50.280
No charge. Get in.

05:51.920 --> 05:52.840
Thanks, sir.

05:59.560 --> 06:00.520
Eat.

06:02.240 --> 06:04.480
Do you want to stay over tonight?

06:05.080 --> 06:05.880
Huh?

06:05.960 --> 06:08.120
I run a Trojan Horse Hotel here.
It's upstairs.

06:08.200 --> 06:10.440
I… I don't have money.

06:10.520 --> 06:13.440
No need to pay. Free.

06:14.120 --> 06:15.560
It's convenient
both upstairs and downstairs.

06:15.640 --> 06:17.800
Everything's right here.
Do whatever you like.

06:17.880 --> 06:19.000
Sounds good.

06:19.080 --> 06:20.200
Sounds good.

06:20.280 --> 06:22.200
-That's nice!
-Nice!

06:22.280 --> 06:23.120
Eat.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.040
One pony.

06:27.480 --> 06:28.480
Two ponies.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.840
Three ponies.

06:31.520 --> 06:33.080
Four ponies.

06:34.600 --> 06:36.240
I have four ponies.

06:36.920 --> 06:38.840
I cook for them every day.

06:38.920 --> 06:41.480
I study with them
and teach them how to behave.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.640
What about Han Zi'ang?

06:44.720 --> 06:45.760
What's wrong with him?

06:53.320 --> 06:54.880
This pony is too disobedient.

06:55.520 --> 06:57.720
Too disobedient. Too disobedient!

06:59.120 --> 07:00.400
Too disobedient.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.960
You must be starving. Eat up.

07:08.040 --> 07:09.200
Thanks, sir.

07:09.840 --> 07:10.880
My mom already cooked.

07:10.960 --> 07:12.080
She's waiting at home.

07:46.440 --> 07:48.280
Help! Help!

08:56.040 --> 08:58.160
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

08:58.240 --> 08:59.440
You're back?

09:00.280 --> 09:01.120
You're back.

09:01.800 --> 09:04.000
Peng is weird. Why's he ignoring me?

09:04.080 --> 09:05.400
-Right.
-No idea.

09:13.640 --> 09:16.760
"If life deceives you…"

09:17.440 --> 09:20.640
"If life deceives you…"

09:21.840 --> 09:25.560
"…don't be sad, don't be anxious."

09:26.160 --> 09:29.520
"…don't be sad, don't be anxious."

09:29.600 --> 09:30.920
"Believe it,

09:31.000 --> 09:32.320
-the happy days…"
-Daddy Peng,

09:33.960 --> 09:35.200
I need the bathroom.

09:42.120 --> 09:43.400
Go ahead.

09:48.280 --> 09:49.680
Come on. Let's continue.

09:50.720 --> 09:54.040
"The heart always longs for the future."

09:54.640 --> 09:57.600
"The heart always longs for the future."

09:57.680 --> 10:01.000
"Now is often full of sorrow."

10:11.840 --> 10:14.480
Pony, where's the bathroom?

10:17.520 --> 10:18.960
Let go of me! You bad guy!

10:22.760 --> 10:25.240
You bit me! How dare you bite me!

10:25.960 --> 10:27.680
That's for biting me! Try that again!

10:28.560 --> 10:29.680
I swear I'll kill you.

10:31.760 --> 10:33.240
You never listen. Serves you right.

10:38.280 --> 10:39.120
Dad…

10:40.280 --> 10:41.120
Dad…

10:41.920 --> 10:43.600
-Dad…
-Pony?

10:56.280 --> 10:59.360
Pony? You're back!

11:06.240 --> 11:07.840
Pony!

11:11.440 --> 11:14.440
I missed you!

11:15.480 --> 11:18.200
I missed you!

11:22.720 --> 11:25.520
My pony!

11:35.480 --> 11:36.320
Good work.

11:37.320 --> 11:39.120
Leave the rest to us.

12:01.760 --> 12:03.000
I've been looking for you everywhere.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.560
How'd you end up here?

12:04.640 --> 12:07.480
Listen, you did a great job today.

12:07.560 --> 12:09.480
Director Zou just called.

12:09.560 --> 12:12.480
He said he'll be highlighting

12:12.560 --> 12:15.680
He Xiaohe at the case briefing.

12:15.760 --> 12:18.080
He also granted our task force
three days off.

12:21.080 --> 12:23.240
What's wrong?

12:25.320 --> 12:26.280
Something on your mind?

12:28.240 --> 12:31.400
Peng Dachuang may be alive,

12:33.920 --> 12:37.320
but he never really
made it out of that fire.

12:39.000 --> 12:42.360
He tried everything
to make it up to his son.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.040
He's completely consumed by it.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.800
I remember Captain Ran mentioned
a theory in his book.

12:55.520 --> 12:56.920
It's called "the domino effect".

12:57.000 --> 13:01.960
In this case,
a lot of seemingly unrelated events

13:02.040 --> 13:05.680
are actually like dominoes
spaced far apart.

13:05.760 --> 13:09.480
Maybe the first domino to fall

13:09.560 --> 13:11.480
was Peng Dachuang's son.

13:16.080 --> 13:19.440
Family is… a strange thing.

13:20.400 --> 13:23.720
When everything's fine,
people start looking for trouble,

13:24.640 --> 13:26.000
like they have to break it somehow.

13:28.840 --> 13:31.680
But if it's missing a piece,

13:34.600 --> 13:36.720
people try hard to fix it.

13:44.280 --> 13:46.680
I never thought I'd become a cop.

13:49.800 --> 13:50.960
But when Uncle Ran was gone,

13:52.760 --> 13:54.040
my family felt incomplete.

13:56.120 --> 13:57.320
I wanted to fix it.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.760
Among all these lit windows,

14:08.320 --> 14:11.040
if one belonged to Uncle Ran,

14:13.800 --> 14:15.000
that'd be nice.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.120
SONG QINGSONG, DUE TO COLLUSION
BETWEEN WU SHANLONG AND ZHAO HONGMEI

14:34.200 --> 14:35.280
WROTE A RANSOM LETTER IN XU MENG'S NAME

14:35.360 --> 14:36.440
FURTHER USING XU MENG'S DEATH

14:36.520 --> 14:38.760
AND THE LEAKED DONGSHAN MINE BID
TO FORCE SONG QINGSONG OUT OF WEIYANG

14:39.800 --> 14:41.040
After the Mount Wu accident,

14:41.640 --> 14:43.680
Xu Meng, to pay
for her father's treatment,

14:43.760 --> 14:46.800
went to Yuanlongli and worked
at Pattia as a masseuse.

14:46.880 --> 14:50.360
That decision was like the first domino

14:50.440 --> 14:52.320
in a long chain to fall,

14:52.400 --> 14:54.600
setting off a chain reaction.

15:18.840 --> 15:19.880
Had a nightmare?

15:21.200 --> 15:22.280
What time is it?

15:25.760 --> 15:27.840
-Is the report done yet?
-Almost done.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.760
Perfect. Take a look
and give me your thoughts.

15:34.080 --> 15:36.680
I'm not used to this. Print it out later.

15:39.560 --> 15:43.160
Sir, we've gone paperless
at the bureau now,

15:43.240 --> 15:45.520
and there's a new
office automation system too.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.200
I got you an account set up.

15:47.280 --> 15:49.400
The username is your full name in pinyin,

15:49.480 --> 15:51.840
-and the password is…
-What system or whatever,

15:52.440 --> 15:53.480
I don't get it.

15:54.200 --> 15:58.280
Me and this computer
just don't get each other.

15:59.080 --> 16:00.200
Whoever wants it can use it.

16:10.280 --> 16:11.800
THE JUNE 30TH CASE HAS MULTIPLE SUSPECTS
AND TANGLED LEADS…

16:16.480 --> 16:20.360
With Song Qingsong's jump,
the June 30th case has to be closed.

16:21.240 --> 16:23.960
I never thought my first case

16:24.480 --> 16:26.480
would end like this with a full stop.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.640
At best, it's just a pause.

16:29.160 --> 16:31.600
As for Xu Meng, her body's still missing.

16:35.480 --> 16:39.360
Maybe one day,
her remains will surface again.

16:40.840 --> 16:43.160
When that happens,
don't you start crying again.

16:46.720 --> 16:47.560
Sir,

16:48.680 --> 16:50.760
if it weren't for you
scolding me back then,

16:50.840 --> 16:53.240
I'd probably be a teacher now.

16:53.320 --> 16:55.200
Good that you know.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.640
By the way, sir,

17:04.720 --> 17:06.160
I've already filed a request

17:06.240 --> 17:08.640
to transfer you
to the administrative department.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.720
It's a new department,

17:14.800 --> 17:18.040
not much workload, so you can spend
more time with Xiaohe.

17:24.960 --> 17:25.800
Sounds good.

17:29.760 --> 17:33.000
This little troublemaker
used to skip class every day.

17:33.720 --> 17:36.600
Winter break's coming.
Might as well help her with her studies.

17:39.040 --> 17:39.920
Sounds good.

17:41.200 --> 17:43.560
Let's go. Let's grab some rice noodles.

17:45.120 --> 17:48.000
I haven't finished the report.
Why don't you rest a bit longer?

17:48.080 --> 17:50.120
You want me to keep
having nightmares, right?

17:50.200 --> 17:52.320
-Let's go.
-Coming.

17:56.280 --> 17:58.080
Let me remind you,

17:58.160 --> 18:00.360
don't just focus on work.

18:00.440 --> 18:03.040
You need to think
about your personal life too.

18:04.080 --> 18:05.440
I'm not in a rush.

18:05.520 --> 18:06.840
You're not, but I am.

18:06.920 --> 18:09.920
You two, not one of you
gives me peace of mind.

18:10.000 --> 18:12.080
How am I not giving you peace of mind?

18:14.640 --> 18:16.520
Let me introduce myself

18:17.240 --> 18:20.400
They call me a beggar…

18:21.520 --> 18:25.680
A flood took both my parents

18:25.760 --> 18:29.520
Now I live all alone

18:30.720 --> 18:34.920
With a worn-out begging basket

18:35.000 --> 18:38.520
And a bamboo stick to fend off dogs

18:39.200 --> 18:44.080
I wander through streets and alleys

18:44.160 --> 18:46.880
Past butcher stalls

18:46.960 --> 18:48.680
And restaurants

18:49.200 --> 18:53.280
Pawnshops and bank counters

18:53.360 --> 18:57.560
Calling out to ladies and gentlemen

18:57.640 --> 19:00.240
Have pity on this poor beggar…

19:00.320 --> 19:04.560
Young little girl, no spirit,

19:05.200 --> 19:07.560
can't even match an old man.

19:09.720 --> 19:11.920
Don't lie there. Come eat
the celebratory noodles.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.880
Just noodles for a celebration?

19:15.960 --> 19:17.520
Not even a bit of oil?

19:17.600 --> 19:18.920
So what?

19:19.440 --> 19:22.720
Back then, your Uncle Ran and I
celebrated with noodles too.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.320
Hurry up. Come here.

19:36.440 --> 19:39.440
What are you looking at?
Do I have oil on my face?

19:40.480 --> 19:45.080
Dad, have you seen Uncle Ran again lately?

19:46.360 --> 19:47.800
What do you mean?

19:47.880 --> 19:50.040
You want me to do therapy again?

19:50.120 --> 19:52.800
Drop that idea.

19:52.880 --> 19:53.800
I'm telling you,

19:54.520 --> 19:57.960
right now, I'm positive and healthy,

19:58.040 --> 19:59.560
better than you young people.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.520
Hurry up. The noodles are getting cold.

20:01.600 --> 20:02.560
Come on.

20:05.280 --> 20:06.320
Eat.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.720
Everything in here belonged to Uncle Ran.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.760
You weren't really yourself before,
but now that you're better,

20:25.480 --> 20:28.000
I can finally
give these things back to you.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.440
Here, Comrade He Yuanhang.

21:12.960 --> 21:16.240
RETURNED MAIL: NO SUCH PERSON AT ADDRESS

21:16.320 --> 21:18.400
When you retired two years ago,

21:18.480 --> 21:20.120
you sent out all these letters.

21:21.160 --> 21:24.240
But they were all returned.

21:25.120 --> 21:27.520
Later, I checked with the registry.

21:29.360 --> 21:32.800
They said Uncle Ran's grandma
passed away in 1992.

21:43.960 --> 21:45.960
MAIL TO GRANDMA IN SHANDONG

21:46.040 --> 21:48.000
FROM WEIYANG, SICHUAN

21:50.720 --> 21:52.920
MAIL TO GRANDMA IN SHANDONG

21:53.000 --> 21:54.120
FROM WEIYANG, SICHUAN

21:54.200 --> 21:55.320
I didn't expect that all those years…

21:55.400 --> 21:56.760
MAIL TO GRANDMA

21:56.840 --> 22:00.800
…Uncle Ran had been writing letters
to his late grandma.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.000
This guy

22:08.520 --> 22:10.400
carries too many people in his heart.

22:12.040 --> 22:15.640
The living and the gone.

22:23.640 --> 22:26.760
How come I have no memory of any of this?

22:33.760 --> 22:34.800
It was that day.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.720
JUNE 3RD, 2013

22:35.800 --> 22:37.040
You suddenly fainted.

22:38.480 --> 22:39.320
After you woke up,

22:39.400 --> 22:42.000
you kept saying Uncle Ran
had come back from Beijing.

22:42.880 --> 22:44.240
I was terrified.

22:44.320 --> 22:46.480
I was afraid these things
would trigger you again.

22:46.560 --> 22:47.600
CHINA POST, SIGNATURE HE YUANHANG

22:47.680 --> 22:49.640
So I hid them all.

23:12.680 --> 23:16.600
This, is there a way
to recover the data inside?

23:17.880 --> 23:18.720
What for?

23:19.680 --> 23:21.960
I want to see if there's anyone left

23:22.040 --> 23:23.840
in your Uncle Ran's hometown
we can contact,

23:26.240 --> 23:28.440
so we can send his belongings back.

23:28.520 --> 23:31.720
So he can finally rest where he belongs.

23:34.880 --> 23:38.360
This thing is so old,
and it's been burned.

23:40.440 --> 23:43.160
Unless… there's some tech genius.

23:53.480 --> 23:58.280
I made you the property manager
to work with me.

23:58.360 --> 23:59.200
And what did you do?

23:59.280 --> 24:01.840
You're in league with those holdouts.

24:02.840 --> 24:04.080
If I don't pull out the big guns,

24:04.160 --> 24:05.720
how are we tearing
this building down next month?

24:05.800 --> 24:06.640
No…

24:08.240 --> 24:09.680
-Officer He?
-Uncle He.

24:14.960 --> 24:17.720
Qian Dajun, what are you up to this time?

24:18.600 --> 24:19.440
Come on.

24:19.520 --> 24:23.760
I'm wholeheartedly thinking
about the community.

24:24.920 --> 24:27.200
What you're saying,
the ghosts here might buy that.

24:27.280 --> 24:28.240
I don't.

24:30.680 --> 24:33.760
NEW YORK BLOCK

24:33.840 --> 24:36.040
Flank him from your side!

24:36.120 --> 24:38.240
I'll ambush him! I see him.

24:38.760 --> 24:39.800
Lure him over!

24:42.840 --> 24:46.200
Uncle He, try another way to say hi.

24:46.280 --> 24:47.560
You nearly scared me to death.

24:47.640 --> 24:50.600
If you keep staying up,
you'll be the one dropping dead.

24:53.320 --> 24:54.600
Take a look at this.

24:54.680 --> 24:58.040
Is there a way to get
the contacts from this phone?

24:59.840 --> 25:03.080
Uncle He, why did you bring
this burnt brick back to me again?

25:03.160 --> 25:05.040
Didn't I already extract it for you
two years ago?

25:05.640 --> 25:07.080
Two years ago?

25:08.080 --> 25:11.480
Two years ago, I worked my tail off.

25:13.040 --> 25:14.760
Why don't I remember any of it?

25:16.160 --> 25:17.920
Forget it. Do it for me again.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.040
No chance.

25:19.120 --> 25:22.880
This thing, once the data was extracted,
the motherboard was fried.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.400
Didn't I email it to you?

25:26.480 --> 25:29.440
All the data is in the attachments.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.360
I don't really get this.

25:31.440 --> 25:33.320
So you emailed me.

25:33.400 --> 25:35.600
Then, the stuff inside,
you didn't keep a copy?

25:36.760 --> 25:39.360
When I work, I leave no evidence.

25:42.600 --> 25:45.440
Uncle He, what email did you use then?

25:48.160 --> 25:49.480
I think…

25:50.160 --> 25:54.080
I think it had an eye icon.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.200
An eye?

26:00.040 --> 26:01.040
Is this it?

26:01.120 --> 26:03.120
Yes! That's it.

26:03.800 --> 26:05.560
The username is my phone number.

26:06.160 --> 26:07.640
The password…

26:08.760 --> 26:09.800
The password…

26:11.120 --> 26:12.400
I forgot it.

26:13.160 --> 26:14.440
No problem.

26:14.520 --> 26:16.920
I've got this. Three seconds.

26:18.880 --> 26:21.480
One. Two. Three.

26:22.720 --> 26:24.800
Who cut my power?

26:24.880 --> 26:28.240
Who else could it be?
That heartless creep.

26:28.320 --> 26:30.080
Qian Dajun!

26:30.160 --> 26:31.800
It must be you!

26:49.560 --> 26:50.440
Slow down.

26:51.320 --> 26:52.440
Easy.

27:03.200 --> 27:05.240
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH, YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE

27:08.280 --> 27:11.440
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION FILES

27:16.880 --> 27:18.040
INTERVIEW RECORD

27:18.120 --> 27:20.640
YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE, SUMMARY REPORT

27:25.280 --> 27:26.680
What's wrong?

27:26.760 --> 27:28.240
The names are reversed.

27:28.320 --> 27:29.840
No need.

27:30.600 --> 27:33.280
He, we need to stick to the facts.

27:33.360 --> 27:34.400
I'm sticking to the facts.

27:35.760 --> 27:37.920
REPORTERS: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG

27:56.280 --> 27:57.960
MENGMENG NO.23

28:39.920 --> 28:40.760
MAIL LOGIN

28:40.840 --> 28:41.720
INCORRECT USERNAME OR PASSWORD

28:57.480 --> 28:59.680
So early, what are you busy with?

29:01.160 --> 29:02.400
Why aren't you at work?

29:03.320 --> 29:06.120
The task force has three days off.
Director Zou approved it.

29:08.080 --> 29:10.360
What's the password for this email?

29:11.360 --> 29:13.080
How did you forget again?

29:13.160 --> 29:15.560
Your full name in pinyin,
plus your birthday.

29:18.120 --> 29:19.360
You haven't used it in years.

29:19.440 --> 29:21.680
Why get trendy now?

29:25.960 --> 29:27.000
INCORRECT USERNAME OR PASSWORD

29:27.720 --> 29:29.040
Still wrong.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.600
Capitalize the first letter.

29:46.560 --> 29:48.240
DU, PHONE RECOVERY

29:50.240 --> 29:53.000
CONTACTS.TXT, TEXTS.TXT, CALL LOG.TXT

29:56.480 --> 29:57.960
CONTACTS.TXT

29:58.040 --> 29:59.480
CONTACT LIST

29:59.560 --> 30:01.560
COUSIN

30:10.200 --> 30:13.680
0535…

30:13.760 --> 30:15.520
32.

30:23.720 --> 30:26.760
Hello. The number you dialed is invalid.

30:26.840 --> 30:28.720
Please check and dial again.

30:38.400 --> 30:39.600
TEXTS

30:43.400 --> 30:44.480
DIRECTOR ZOU: DON'T STAY UP

30:44.560 --> 30:45.640
RAN: DON'T STAY UP TONIGHT

30:45.720 --> 30:46.760
Don't stay up tonight.

30:47.360 --> 30:48.400
Go home and rest early.

30:48.960 --> 30:51.080
I'm fine, senior. I'll leave after work.

30:51.840 --> 30:53.800
That's an order. Go home now.

30:54.840 --> 30:55.680
Copy that.

30:56.800 --> 30:59.840
Ran, I saw a sweater today.
It would look good on you.

30:59.920 --> 31:00.760
SENDER: QIAO

31:00.840 --> 31:02.560
Are you free this weekend?

31:02.640 --> 31:05.200
Sorry, Qiao. I've got to work overtime
this weekend.

31:05.720 --> 31:06.720
Maybe next week.

31:07.320 --> 31:09.360
Let's find a day for dinner.

31:09.440 --> 31:12.120
Okay. Don't overwork yourself.

31:12.200 --> 31:13.600
Get some rest.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.600
Don't worry.

31:22.600 --> 31:24.200
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

31:35.640 --> 31:38.280
Dad, what's wrong?

31:40.320 --> 31:41.320
Dad.

31:55.880 --> 31:59.240
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

31:59.320 --> 32:04.480
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG
ALL WRONG

32:08.760 --> 32:11.120
This message, I never received it.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.520
Ran never sent it to me.

32:14.880 --> 32:16.400
The June 30th case?

32:17.000 --> 32:19.400
Isn't that the Xu father-daughter case?

32:19.480 --> 32:21.280
Wasn't it closed long ago?

32:22.000 --> 32:24.680
Why would Uncle Ran write this?

32:25.880 --> 32:28.960
He must have gone behind my back
to reinvestigate it

32:29.880 --> 32:31.720
and found a major clue.

32:32.320 --> 32:33.280
So major…

32:34.480 --> 32:37.040
it could overturn
all previous conclusions.

32:40.800 --> 32:42.880
Dad. Look.

32:43.880 --> 32:46.640
That was the night
something happened to Uncle Ran.

32:46.720 --> 32:49.600
But this message
was drafted that afternoon.

32:57.360 --> 32:59.320
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE
SAVE AT 2003-01-31 13:09:37

33:01.920 --> 33:03.760
What was he trying to tell me?

33:04.680 --> 33:06.480
Why didn't he send it?

33:07.760 --> 33:10.320
Ran must have left with deep regrets.

33:12.240 --> 33:14.280
Why didn't I see this email sooner?

33:18.840 --> 33:20.920
PHONE RECOVERY BY DU ON JUNE 3RD, 2013

33:26.240 --> 33:28.840
Dad, I brought food back.

33:28.920 --> 33:30.040
Eat it while it's hot.

33:36.520 --> 33:37.640
Dad?

33:45.600 --> 33:46.800
Dad?

33:48.000 --> 33:49.920
Dad! What did you do? Dad!

33:50.520 --> 33:52.720
Don't scare me! Wake up! Dad!

33:52.800 --> 33:55.800
What did you do? Dad!

33:56.320 --> 33:58.520
Don't scare me! Dad!

33:59.480 --> 34:00.320
Dad!

34:00.400 --> 34:01.240
JUNE 3RD, 2013

34:01.320 --> 34:02.160
Dad!

34:03.440 --> 34:04.320
Dad!

34:04.840 --> 34:06.080
PHONE RECOVERY BY DU ON JUNE 3RD, 2013

34:06.160 --> 34:07.360
I get it now.

34:08.400 --> 34:09.239
That time you fainted,

34:09.320 --> 34:10.760
it must've been
because you saw this message.

34:10.840 --> 34:13.120
That's why you kept imagining
Uncle Ran had come back.

34:16.639 --> 34:19.880
So, this is the root of your illness.

34:23.080 --> 34:25.800
I saw this message two years ago?

34:27.080 --> 34:29.600
Dad, think hard again.

34:30.360 --> 34:31.560
After the case was closed,

34:31.639 --> 34:34.520
did Uncle Ran ever mention
the June 30th case again?

34:40.639 --> 34:41.480
Who is it?

34:42.960 --> 34:44.960
Sir, why are you…

34:48.840 --> 34:49.920
What are you doing here?

34:50.520 --> 34:52.679
It's the weekend,
and it's the Winter Solstice.

34:52.760 --> 34:55.520
I brought Qiao to help
warm up your new place.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.120
Ran.

34:59.920 --> 35:01.760
I… I didn't prepare anything.

35:01.840 --> 35:04.120
We're all friends. No need for all that.

35:05.240 --> 35:06.400
Let her in already.

35:08.160 --> 35:09.080
Come in.

35:09.160 --> 35:11.000
The floor is dirty.
No need to change shoes.

35:16.760 --> 35:19.680
Nice place. The bureau treats you well.

35:20.280 --> 35:21.720
Just a bit musty.

35:22.640 --> 35:23.480
It needs more life.

35:23.560 --> 35:26.240
Have people over more. It'll be fine.

35:26.320 --> 35:28.640
I'll get some plants for Ran later on.

35:29.560 --> 35:30.800
Sounds good.

35:36.120 --> 35:37.600
Don't bother.

35:37.680 --> 35:40.240
You rarely come by. Let's eat downstairs.

35:41.080 --> 35:42.600
Why eat at a restaurant?

35:42.680 --> 35:44.800
We're not just warming your home,
we're firing up your kitchen too.

35:44.880 --> 35:46.840
Qiao said she'd cook for you.

35:46.920 --> 35:48.600
How can you refuse?

36:05.440 --> 36:06.640
How nice.

36:13.120 --> 36:15.840
Oh no. I forgot to pick up Xiaohe.

36:16.720 --> 36:17.600
You two eat first.

36:19.520 --> 36:20.680
Sir.

36:22.120 --> 36:23.440
Today is Sunday.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.320
Is it?

36:27.880 --> 36:29.520
Then she definitely
didn't do her homework.

36:29.600 --> 36:31.880
I need to keep an eye on her. You two eat.

36:33.040 --> 36:34.400
Sir!

36:38.040 --> 36:39.440
I'll… see him out.

36:41.440 --> 36:42.280
Sir!

36:44.040 --> 36:46.000
Stay and have a bite with us.

36:46.080 --> 36:47.000
No.

36:47.080 --> 36:50.520
She's already putting herself out there.
You should show some interest too.

36:50.600 --> 36:52.360
Qiao is a good girl.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.280
Don't let her slip away.

36:59.040 --> 36:59.880
Sir,

37:00.760 --> 37:04.000
how's work in the new department?

37:05.440 --> 37:07.760
It's much easier than field duty.

37:08.440 --> 37:09.760
I'm thinking of writing

37:10.280 --> 37:12.560
something about the June 30th case
when I get the time.

37:12.640 --> 37:14.080
A detailed one.

37:14.160 --> 37:16.600
If similar cases come up,
it can be a reference.

37:18.600 --> 37:22.200
Me? All I can do now
is stay in the archives.

37:23.040 --> 37:24.200
I have no choice.

37:24.280 --> 37:27.120
My memory keeps betraying me.

37:27.680 --> 37:33.040
Sir, do you remember the blue heels
from the June 30th case?

37:33.120 --> 37:34.680
Blue heels? What about them?

37:35.920 --> 37:37.920
The bureau had a pipe burst the other day.

37:38.000 --> 37:41.120
Water was everywhere.
We spent ages cleaning up.

37:41.200 --> 37:44.440
But those blue heels just went missing.

37:47.560 --> 37:49.440
Maybe they were cleared out as junk?

37:49.520 --> 37:50.840
But the case is already closed.

37:51.440 --> 37:53.160
Doesn't matter if they're missing.

37:55.040 --> 37:56.040
Alright. That's far enough.

37:56.120 --> 37:58.080
Qiao is still busy upstairs.

37:58.160 --> 38:00.240
Go help her. I'm off.

38:03.160 --> 38:04.360
Take care.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.040
Blue heels.

38:14.080 --> 38:15.360
Ran mentioned the blue heels.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.000
What blue heels?

38:18.080 --> 38:20.600
In the June 30th case evidence,
there was a pair of blue heels.

38:20.680 --> 38:22.960
They were what Xu Meng was wearing
when she went missing.

38:23.960 --> 38:26.400
Those blue heels
were one of the key pieces

38:26.480 --> 38:28.000
of evidence against Wu Shanlong.

38:28.080 --> 38:32.400
Ran mentioned before that
when a pipe burst at the bureau,

38:32.480 --> 38:35.280
he noticed those blue heels were missing.

38:35.360 --> 38:38.480
The shoes went missing.
That doesn't prove anything.

38:38.560 --> 38:39.920
How does it not prove anything?

38:40.800 --> 38:42.040
It means back then,

38:42.120 --> 38:44.200
Ran was already reinvestigating this case.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.360
Otherwise, how would he know

38:45.440 --> 38:47.320
that the evidence box
was missing evidence?

38:49.200 --> 38:51.640
You go to the archives right now

38:51.720 --> 38:53.840
and check the June 30th case files.

38:53.920 --> 38:55.840
See if Ran added any new evidence.

38:56.600 --> 38:57.560
Okay.

39:05.440 --> 39:06.560
Dad,

39:07.160 --> 39:09.320
do we really need to push
this case this far?

39:11.080 --> 39:13.440
These were Uncle Ran's last words.

39:13.520 --> 39:15.160
Do you think we shouldn't push this?

39:22.800 --> 39:25.320
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

39:25.400 --> 39:28.280
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG
ALL WRONG

39:52.560 --> 39:55.200
WOODCUT KNIFE
